{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "be499172-4e57-89bb-9ba9-f8e045a1617e",
  "created_at": "2025-12-09T10:15:05-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "George Burdick",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Priya Raman",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:11:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Priya. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:11:47-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi, this is George Burdick. I got a water and sewer bill that is way too high, no way that is right. It's like double what I normally pay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:11:59-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can look at that. What's the account number, or the service address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:12:05-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, so I have two properties, okay, and I think I have the, the bills mixed up. [line breaks up] one is the rental and one is where I live. I got both envelopes here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:12:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Read me the account number off the one that's too high, and we'll go from there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:12:25-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, the high one, it says, hold on, it ends in four-four-one-seven. No wait, that is the rental. The one I live in is the other one, that one is normal."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:12:37-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the rental account, ending in four-four-one-seven, is the one that jumped. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:12:43-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes. That one. No way the rental uses that much, nobody even lives there since [line breaks up] November. It's empty."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:12:52-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I see the account. The last reading is much higher than the previous quarter, you're right about that. Sometimes that points to a leak on the property side, like a running toilet or a broken pipe."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:13:06-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A leak, no way. I went there last week, everything was dry. I think the reading is wrong. I'm not paying for that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:13:15-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. I can note that you're questioning the reading and request a re-read of the meter. That's usually the first step."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:13:24-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, but how do I dispute it formally? Like in writing, so it's on the record. I don't want just a phone note."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:13:33-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can send a written request for review to the water division. Include the account number, the service address, the bill date, and why you think it's wrong. I'll put today's call on the account too, so there's a record of when you first raised it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:13:50-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And the, uh, [inaudible] my mother, she is in her seventies and she has her own bill, different account. Is there any discount for low-income or elderly people? She is on a fixed income."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:14:03-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm not aware of a standing discount program I can promise you on this line. I can transfer you to someone in the billing office who can tell you whether anything exists for seniors, or she can ask when she calls herself."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:14:19-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, maybe she calls. But, um, back to mine. When do they read the meter again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:14:26-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm entering the re-read request now. Typically it's within a week or so, and it may take a little longer after the storm Saturday, since crews were busy. Is the number you're calling from the best one for a callback?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:14:41-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-six-six."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:14:44-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-six-six. Someone will call once the reading comes back. In the meantime, hold off on worrying about the due date; I'm flagging the account as disputed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:14:56-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. That is good. Thank you, Priya. I just want it fixed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:15:01-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Have a good rest of your day, Mr. Burdick."
    }
  ],
